OL,3,AUnheard Oasis recordings valued at
OL,4,A#1.6m for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe collection, known as The Desk
OL,7,FTapes, has been in the possession of
OL,8,FOwain Richards for 20 years, after his
OL,9,Fdad, a former front-of-house sound
OL,10,Fengineer joined the band's crew during
OL,11,Ftheir heyday.
